Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:49:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add a continue recording button to the voice message
 composer

Stopping a recording used to finalize it: the user had to either send the
voice message or record it again from scratch.

Now stopping the recording only pauses it, keeping the recording session (and
therefore the audio file) alive, and the preview shows a continue button to the
left of the send button which resumes the very same audio stream. The preview
duration and waveform keep growing across the segments, and sending finalizes
the recording first so the sent file is a single Ogg/Opus voice message.

Pausing on ON_PAUSE means the recording can also be continued after coming back
from the background. Deleting or sending finalizes the session, and leaving the
screen (ON_DESTROY) discards it.
